```
from typing import Annotated
from kedi.typesafe import Probability
Evidence = Annotated[
    Probability,
    "Does the ticket explicitly describe a billing or technical issue?",
]
```
> adapter: pydantic
> model: typesafe/jev-latest
[ticket] = I was charged twice for the same invoice.
>> Classify <ticket>. Department: [department: Literal["billing", "technical"]]. Evidence: [evidence: `Evidence`].
> if: `evidence > 0.85`:
  = <department>
> else:
  = review
